          ">¡Hola, Ñoño, Aurelia y Tomás!</h2><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center sm:gap-8"><p class="
          font-script text-3xl text-[#f6efe2]/90
          [text-shadow:0_1px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]
          sm:text-4xl
        ">Nos casamos</p><h1 class="
          font-display text-4xl leading-[1.05] text-[#f6efe2]
          [text-shadow:0_2px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]
          sm:text-6xl
        ">Ana y Bruno</h1><time datetime="2026-11-28" data-testid="save-the-date-when" class="
          text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6efe2]/85 uppercase
          [text-shadow:0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]
          sm:text-sm sm:tracking-[0.25em]
        ">sábado, 28 de noviembre de 2026</time><span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-px w-16 bg-[#f6efe2]/30 sm:w-24"></span><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3"><p class="sr-only" data-testid="countdown-summary">Faltan 67 días para la boda.</p><ol aria-hidden="true" data-testid="countdown-figures" class="flex items-start justify-center gap-5 sm:gap-8"><li data-testid="countdown-unit"><div class="flex min-w-14 flex-col items-center gap-1 sm:min-w-20"><span data-testid="countdown-figure" class="font-display text-3xl leading-none tabular-nums text-[#f6efe2] sm:text-5xl">67</span><span data-testid="countdown-label" class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6efe2]/65 sm:text-xs">días</span></div></li><li data-testid="countdown-unit"><div class="flex min-w-14 flex-col items-center gap-1 sm:min-w-20"><span data-testid="countdown-figure" class="font-display text-3xl leading-none tabular-nums text-[#f6efe2] sm:text-5xl">6</span><span data-testid="countdown-label" class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6efe2]/65 sm:text-xs">horas</span></div></li><li data-testid="countdown-unit"><div class="flex min-w-14 flex-col items-center gap-1 sm:min-w-20"><span data-testid="countdown-figure" class="font-display text-3xl leading-none tabular-nums text-[#f6efe2] sm:text-5xl">0</span><span data-testid="countdown-label" class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6efe2]/65 sm:text-xs">minutos</span></div></li><li data-testid="countdown-unit"><div class="flex min-w-14 flex-col items-center gap-1 sm:min-w-20"><span data-testid="countdown-figure" class="font-display text-3xl leading-none tabular-nums text-[#f6efe2] sm:text-5xl">0</span><span data-testid="countdown-label" class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6efe2]/65 sm:text-xs">segundos</span></div></li></ol></div></div><p class="
            invitation__lead max-w-sm text-sm text-[#f6efe2]/85
            [text-shadow:0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]
            sm:text-base
          ">Nos alegra mucho invitarlos a celebrar nuestro matrimonio.</p></header><section class="invitation__household"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-auto mb-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#f6efe2]/30 sm:w-24"></span><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-0"><li class="text-sm text-[#f6efe2] [text-shadow:0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] sm:text-base">Ñoño Muñóz</li><li class="text-sm text-[#f6efe2] [text-shadow:0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] sm:text-base">Aurelia Muñóz</li><li class="text-sm text-[#f6efe2] [text-shadow:0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] sm:text-base">Tomás Muñóz <span class="text-[#f6efe2]/60">(niño o niña)</span></li></ul></section><p class="invitation__deadline text-center text-xs text-[#f6efe2]/70">Confirmen su asistencia antes del 21 de noviembre de 2026.</p></article>"
`;

